WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.334
The robot arm approaches the blue can from above, grasps it, lifts it, and moves it to the left to place it into the white basket.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Move arm down and left to approach the blue can from above

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Grasp the blue can

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Lift the can and move it left towards the basket

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lower the can into the basket and release it

6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Retract arm upwards and away from the basket
